<title>USA: WMX to buy back 30 mln shrs at $30/shr.</title>
<headline>WMX to buy back 30 mln shrs at $30/shr.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>WMX Technologies Inc said it has accepted for purchase 30 million shares of its stock at $30 per share as the final result of a Dutch auction repurchase program.</p>
<p>The offer was oversubscribed with about 87.7 million shares tendered and not withdrawn at the final $30 per share offer price. The final proration factor for those shares is about 34.04 percent, WMX said.</p>
<p>Payment for the shares to be repurchased will begin Tuesday and shares not purchased will be returned promptly, said the largest U.S. trash hauling company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
